{'symbol': 'AMD', 'date': '2021-12-13 09:00:00', 'title': 'AMD TO HOST 2022 PRODUCT PREMIERE LIVESTREAM EVENT', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., DEC. 13, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0 AMD (NASDAQ: AMD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT AMD PRESIDENT AND CEO DR. LISA SU WILL HOST ITS 2022 PRODUCT PREMIERE ON JANUARY 4, 2022. DR. SU WILL HIGHLIGHT INNOVATIONS AND SOLUTIONS FEATURING UPCOMING AMD RYZEN™ PROCESSORS AND AMD RADEON™ GRAPHICS.'}